				<Item class="Script" referent="RBX5081">
					<Properties>
						<bool name="Disabled">false</bool>
						<Content name="LinkedSource"><null></null></Content>
						<string name="Name">Instructions</string>
						<ProtectedString name="Source">Tzsara&apos;s easy morph kit!

Color the bricks whatever color you want, or add decals.
You can also add bricks, just group them with whatever they are. (For example, if you were making a cyborg, and you wanted it to have a robot arm, add the parts into one of the
arm groups- Arm1 or Arm2)

Where it says &quot;Name of Morph&quot; you can rename it to whatever you want. In this case, you might want to rename it to &quot;Noob&quot; or &quot;Noob Morph&quot; because it looks like a morph.

Have fun, and I hope this helped you!

-Tzsara</ProtectedString>
					</Properties>
				</Item>
			</Item>
		</Item>
